 {'id':'L22-COVERAGE-01','status':'open','sourcePages':[673,684],'finding':'The actual motor cutaway labels the brush, encoder, commutator, magnet/ironless winding, reduction gearhead and output shaft. Existing Q003 tests only stator/armature/commutator prose roles, while Q031 traces the system-level blocks. Add one meaningful diagram/component-role match distinguishing encoder measurement, brush/commutator current interface and reduction gearing. Do not turn every decorative label into a separate recall item.'},
